<%# Cage + ball + ring showing the last drawn number.
  The ball and its idle orbit are always visible; only the ring (letter +
  number) is hidden until the first ball is drawn. "Spinning" (fast orbit +
  shake + pulse ring) is toggled by spin_controller.js while a draw request
  is in flight — see the wrapping element in show.html.erb.
  Locals:
    draw - Draw instance or nil
%>
<div data-spin-target="cage" class="relative w-[230px] h-[230px] rounded-full bg-bingo-cage border-[1.5px] border-bingo-line flex items-center justify-center">
  <div class="bingo-orbit absolute inset-[10px] rounded-full animate-orbit">
    <span class="absolute top-1.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-bingo-accent opacity-[0.35]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="absolute bottom-1.5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-bingo-fg opacity-[0.14]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="absolute left-1.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-bingo-accent opacity-[0.22]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="bingo-ball relative w-[150px] h-[150px] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center animate-ball-pop">
    <% if draw %>
      <div class="bingo-ring w-[104px] h-[104px] rounded-full flex items-baseline justify-center gap-[5px]">
        <span class="font-display font-bold text-xl leading-none"><%= bingo_letter(draw.number) %></span>
        <span class="font-display font-bold text-[46px] leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><%= draw.number %></span>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
